WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.091
The takeaway: context as a first-class input
unlocks better learned auctions.

00:00:05.171 --> 00:00:10.262
CITransNet is near-optimal, asymmetric when needed,
and incentive-compatible.

00:00:10.342 --> 00:00:16.910
Its size-independent parameter count lets one
trained model transfer to auction sizes it never saw.
